		{
			dependencies: ["3FFCC2BE71CF1CC5"]
			description: [
				"Spells live on &escrolls&f. A scroll casts once. Write it into a &espellbook&f and it is yours for good."
				""
				"Casting spends &9mana&f, the blue bar above your hotbar. It refills by itself; rings, robes and skill nodes make it bigger and faster. Ars Nouveau casts from the same bar."
				""
				"Hold your spellbook and press &eR&f to choose a spell, right-click to cast. Scrolls turn up in chests all over the world, and each school has a master who sells them."
				"&7Made at: &fCreate sequenced assembly &7from &fTuff x4"
